# JLPT N4

## 可能形
| グループ | 変形  |
| --- | --- | --- |
| I | い→え |
| II | +られ |
| III | きます➝こられます |
| III | します➝できます |
を→が



```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{普通形}} \\
  \text{形容詞}_{\text{い}} \\
  \text{形容詞}_{\text{な}}\text{（}\cancel{\text{だ}}\rightarrow \text{な）} \\
  \text{N（}\cancel{\text{だ}}\rightarrow \text{な）}
\end{array}
\right]\text{んです}
```

```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{て形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{いただけませんか}
```

```math
\text{V}_{\text{疑問詞＋問題て形}}\text{らいいですか}
```

```math
\text{Nは}\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{好きです・嫌いです} \\
  \text{上手です・下手です} \\
  \text{あります・います・etc}
\end{array}
\right]
```

が[みえます・聞こえます]
They come into sight / ears indpenent to one's will

ができます
Be completed / finished

しか
Can only do something and always use as negative, suggests insufficiency or indaquacy

Nは…。Nは…。
Contrast to a object 

```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{ます形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{ながら}\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{ます形}}
\end{array}
\right]
```

```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{て形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{います}
```
1. Indicating what is doing now 
2. Indicate as a habitual behavior
3. Show the state resulting from the action (自動詞) …が…


```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{文}_{\text{普通形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{し、}\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{文}_{\text{普通形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{し、～}
```

それで
So

```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{て形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{しまいました・しまいます}
```
Has been completed / will be compelted in the future


ありました
Found something now. Doesn't indicate it was here 

```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{て形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{あります}
```
他動詞
A situation due to someone's action

```math
\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{V}_{\text{て形}}
\end{array}
\right]\text{おきます}
```
Necessary action / preparation

```math
\text{まだ}\left[
\begin{array}{l}
  \text{文}_{\text{肯定}}
\end{array}
\right]
```

とか
skip listing everything